{"availability":"available","full":"KruxAI/ragbuilder","name":"ragbuilder","description":"A toolkit to create optimal Production-readyRetrieval Augmented Generation(RAG) setup for your data","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1539,"forks":127,"created":"2024-06-24T07:25:00Z","updated":"2026-10-02T02:28:43Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ragbuilder.pages.dev","topics":["developer-tools","genai","rag"],"demo":"https://ragbuilder.pages.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.702Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.702Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.702Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.702Z","stars":1539,"forks":127}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Maintenance status: RAGBuilder is no longer actively maintained. This repository is kept for reference. Ongoing updates and support are not planned.","RagBuilder is a toolkit that helps you create optimal Production-ready Retrieval-Augmented-Generation (RAG) setup for your data automatically. By performing hyperparameter tuning on various RAG parameters (Eg: chunking strategy: semantic, character etc., chunk size: 1000, 2000 etc.), RagBuilder evaluates these configurations against a test dataset to identify the best-performing setup for your data. Additionally, RagBuilder includes several state-of-the-art, pre-defined RAG templates that have shown strong performance across diverse datasets. So just bring your data, and RagBuilder will…"],"features":["Hyperparameter Tuning: Efficiently optimize your RAG configurations using Bayesian optimization","Pre-defined RAG Templates: Use state-of-the-art templates that have demonstrated strong performance Eg: Graph retriever, Contextual chunker etc.)","Evaluation Dataset Options: Generate synthetic test dataset or provide your own","Component Access: Direct access to vectorstore, retriever, and generator components","API Deployment: Easily deploy as an API service"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KruxAI/ragbuilder/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b90899f9173be0dd9a3d8ea90bdc933bd39310239d7442a8730d6cb94b1a4f71","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.869Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.869Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Maintenance status: RAGBuilder is no longer actively maintained. This repository is kept for reference. Ongoing updates and support are not planned.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KruxAI/ragbuilder/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b90899f9173be0dd9a3d8ea90bdc933bd39310239d7442a8730d6cb94b1a4f71","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KruxAI/ragbuilder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.869Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T02:28:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KruxAI/ragbuilder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.870Z","hash":"b90899f9173be0dd9a3d8ea90bdc933bd39310239d7442a8730d6cb94b1a4f71","originalBytes":11775,"storedBytes":11775,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ragbuilder","custom","api","data","config","model","rag","optimization","type","source","default","python","key","project","retrieval","builder","defaults","neo4j","openai","reranker","configuration","here","ingest","retriever","run","test","builder.optimize","class","document","import","kwargs","license","llm","options","password","results","splitter","temperature","vector","via","access","azure","azurechatopenai","azureopenaiembeddings","chunking","dataset","deployment","does","env","evaluation","gpt-4o","initialize","input","large","metrics","optimized","parent","pipeline","ragbuilder.from","retrievers","save","set","text-embedding-3-large","through","trials","bm25","character","chunker","cohere","collector","component","configure","create","data.pdf","embeddings","environment","etc.","file","generation","generator","github","installation","load","loader","